## Copyright License / 版权许可
The licensor grants you a copyright license for the software to do everything you might do with the software that would otherwise infringe the licensor's copyright in it for any permitted purpose.
许可方授予你一项版权许可，允许你为任何许可目的对软件进行一切本会侵犯许可方版权的行为。
However, you may only distribute the software according to Distribution License and make changes or new works based on the software according to Changes and New Works License.
但是，你只能根据“分发许可”分发软件，并只能根据“修改与新作品许可”对软件进行修改或创作新作品。

## Distribution License / 分发许可
The licensor grants you an additional copyright license to distribute copies of the software.
许可方授予你一项额外的版权许可，以分发软件的副本。
Your license to distribute covers distributing the software with changes and new works permitted by Changes and New Works License.
你的分发许可涵盖分发“修改与新作品许可”所允许的、包含修改和新作品的软件。

## Notices / 通知
You must ensure that anyone who gets a copy of any part of the software from you also gets a copy of these terms or the URL for them above, as well as copies of any plain-text lines beginning with `Required Notice:` that the licensor provided with the software.
你必须确保从你处获得软件任何部分副本的任何人，同时获得这些条款的副本或其上方URL，以及许可方随软件提供的、以 `Required Notice:` 开头的任何纯文本行的副本。
For example:
Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026 Primerusse (https://github.com/Primerusse/Course-Project-Code-Repo)

## Changes and New Works License / 修改与新作品许可
The licensor grants you an additional copyright license to make changes and new works based on the software for any permitted purpose.
许可方授予你一项额外的版权许可，允许你为任何许可目的对软件进行修改和创作新作品。

## Patent License / 专利许可
The licensor grants you a patent license for the software that covers patent claims the licensor can license, or becomes able to license, that you would infringe by using the software.
